  "prefLabel": "Bea 502.06 Building permit",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bea 502.06 “Building permit” means a document issued by the state or by a local municipality, other than a zoning permit or land use permit, granting permission to a building owner or builder to construct or renovate a building, building component, or structure within the state or municipality.\n\nSource. #14043, eff 8-8-24",
